  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_26e3626d526145c0af3c89a70e000e79",
      "statement": "registerMapbox registers the road-snapping proxy as GET /mapbox/directions inside the single /api/admin plugin whose preHandler hook is the admin auth guard, so the endpoint is reachable only as GET /api/admin/mapbox/directions by an authenticated admin and inherits the standard { success, data | error } envelope.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/index.ts#L14-L36",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cc5d728f37999836f5a5550cc2b48a7d7d26875865535c4f961dd93326c9549b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L85-L93",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:eb97b171204e655c5da220abc158e7cb650386daf4292592cd34b4cb4fed56a4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bdb894f240ad45d4a4a4b6e9699641aa",
      "statement": "The proxy's request contract is a single coordinates query string of lng,lat pairs separated by semicolons: a missing parameter, a pair that does not coerce to two finite numbers, or fewer than 2 pairs is rejected as 422 VALIDATION_ERROR (a client error) rather than degrading to the fallback.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L13-L27",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:90c92d98ac42695e26d4462077839c022d5517a3b4d0345c2dfc3a434d358315:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L93-L105",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:547480bcfe787344026a8088306f5ef5e72b59ed944d8ad3dd4e1c57f7219d00:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/tests/unit/mapbox-proxy.test.ts#L188-L200",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9dd06a359a702f76675ebed4bbcc8786c35f22da3b8ea7dbb3dfd2f777535939:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d140e8ebbe6144d88e6040c5af821732",
      "statement": "Each chunk is fetched from https://api.mapbox.com/directions/v5/mapbox/driving/<waypoints> with a fixed parameter set of geometries=geojson, overview=full, steps=false, alternatives=false and the secret token passed as the access_token query parameter; no optimize, exclude, language, or timeout options are sent.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L69-L83",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:407975576526774461e5b14f76bc1908d4986f0f57b67f0178fe1bb584251867:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_028e9e8ffc614b308ac7eb51c519f8a9",
      "statement": "Every well-formed request answers HTTP 200 with { success: true, data: { polyline, distance_meters, snapped, warning } }; snapped:true carries Mapbox road geometry with distance_meters equal to the sum of the per-chunk route distances, while snapped:false carries the straight-line fallback. The shared wire schema declares exactly these four fields.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L145-L156",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4215f7ae9f8b989f63ea94357110ef7d77709f7ec0433f40ad2701aace301ff5:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/shared/src/schemas/mapbox.ts#L9-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d022885f9d30ddaa7cee9eb54a7766d3b9ed3477428bf20bd2bce213fb638760:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b4a616145989484d9215b1ea5ed18b61",
      "statement": "Contract (ADR-0009): the proxy forwards geometry and distance only and never upstream durations or instructions - the upstream JSON is narrowed to routes[0].geometry and routes[0].distance, steps=false means no turn-by-turn legs are requested, and the response shape has no duration field.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L132-L143",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:84077c6abf844057f992e04cd318db30438f94da9f95bb7bedd7c83bc6b775e0:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L69-L83",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:407975576526774461e5b14f76bc1908d4986f0f57b67f0178fe1bb584251867:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a849c6586a9e45eaa8778dc3c2010c72",
      "statement": "Waypoints are chunked at MAPBOX_CHUNK_SIZE = 25 into ordered non-overlapping slices; all chunks are fetched concurrently with Promise.all, their geometries are concatenated in chunk order (dropping a chunk's leading coordinate only when it is element-wise identical to the last coordinate already appended), and their distances are summed into distance_meters.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L124-L156",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b0347f25e452c3ea1afc75d778a007d577a3f60ee518fe4bb0e49c0bd12aec25:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L48-L67",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bad9f1688a2c4f58b214b94108dd7317a51d8c6353a0bb01848c29b54c2b9e35:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L6-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:40712d3d1a9cc1e45309700f42fdf22c2c329558abb2ae07dc1d3084511c83db:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c42e550b13624fc4bd04752453725e24",
      "statement": "Chunk fetching is all-or-nothing: a non-OK status, a body without routes[0], or a rejected fetch in any single chunk throws out of the shared try/catch around Promise.all, discarding every successfully snapped chunk and returning the straight-line fallback for the whole coordinate list; a trailing chunk of one waypoint (coordinate counts of 26, 51, 76, ...) is sent unguarded and is therefore the shape most likely to degrade.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L124-L163",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:169efbe00c1256ac836f61abd2593e11e7be16b2df307210986d9c8c974d38d4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L30-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4e47dfd7ec8323946c85683a7957f73978b52020b876fd62c3eb93043086cee1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f0981f9190bc47199381119fa1ffbbe3",
      "statement": "Both failure paths return HTTP 200 with a straight-line LineString through the caller's coordinates, distance_meters 0, snapped false, and a warning of \"no_token\" when MAPBOX_SECRET_TOKEN is absent (returned before any network call) or \"upstream_error\" when the chunked fetch throws (after an app.log.warn); there is deliberately no 5xx path for Mapbox service failure.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/mapbox.ts#L110-L122",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6ca810ecb3c861615d8052b50554c685057511d5b72fecd3dbf9d4f7c31a61bc:"
