    {
      "id": "claim_3948db10f84e47958a10814a69fcd0e3",
      "statement": "MAPBOX_SECRET_TOKEN is optional in the Zod environment schema (absent means the straight-line fallback), and the handler re-reads it per request with loadEnv(process.env) instead of using AppDeps.env, so a token can be picked up without a restart while an otherwise invalid environment would fail this route through the generic 500 INTERNAL handler rather than by falling back.",
