      "statement": "The no_token warning copy tells the admin to add a public Mapbox token named MAPBOX_TOKEN, but the only Mapbox variable the server schema defines is the server-side MAPBOX_SECRET_TOKEN, and the admin basemap renders keyless OpenFreeMap styles, so the copy's instruction does not name a configurable variable.",
