    {
      "id": "claim_7ff7f5d4344f40e08a6c6d006c746c0e",
      "statement": "Client orchestration of the proxy call lives in module scope: requestSnapPreview issues no request with fewer than 2 stops, debounces by SNAP_DEBOUNCE_MS = 300, and a snapGeneration counter makes superseded or late responses no-ops; resolvePendingSnap flushes a pending debounce before a save so the save sees a settled snap state.",
