      "id": "claim_cd0c2e54d0134c698260bf8613d0d965",
      "statement": "The detour loop builder is a second consumer of the same endpoint with different semantics: it keeps only the returned polyline, so a snapped:false fallback body becomes the persisted loop geometry with mapboxWarning left null, and the warning is set to upstream_error only when the request itself throws.",
