      "id": "claim_97852105e3b34516949cd9a3fe0a5cdf",
      "statement": "apps/server/tests/unit/mapbox-proxy.test.ts is the entire server-side suite for this integration: it covers the pure helpers (parseCoordinates, chunkCoordinates, straightLineFallback, concatenateLineStrings, buildDirectionsUrl) and, on a bare Fastify instance with a stubbed global fetch, the no_token, snapped-success, upstream_error and 422 paths - with no test exercising the multi-chunk path through the handler and none asserting the absence of duration or instructions.",
