    {
      "id": "claim_b98b27a8c9ee470a93f08a383d70b053",
      "statement": "The two sides of this boundary do not share a runtime-validated type: snapPreview types the raw response as the camelCase SnappedPath.distanceMeters while the wire field is distance_meters and no mapping exists, leaving snap.distanceMeters undefined at runtime (the displayed distance is recomputed from the polyline instead), and mapboxDirectionsResponseSchema is exported from the shared barrel but applied by neither the server handler nor the admin client.",
