    {
      "id": "claim_e652bb7983d843ee901ce339169a4f91",
      "statement": "The upstream fetch has no timeout, AbortSignal, or retry, and this route has no rate limiting - the only throttler in the server is the login-route throttler - so a hung Mapbox response leaves the client's snap state pending until the socket fails.",
